WEBVTT

00:06:27.156 --> 00:06:31.476
And many of us are familiar
with the 12-step program.

00:06:31.956 --> 00:06:34.276
And many of us are familiar
with the first step,

00:06:34.316 --> 00:06:36.236
which is admitting you have a problem.

00:06:36.876 --> 00:06:40.196
But then it's the other 11 steps
that also matter.

00:06:40.236 --> 00:06:42.596
And Alcoholics Anonymous knows

00:06:42.636 --> 00:06:45.436
that if you master the first 11 steps,

00:06:45.476 --> 00:06:46.636
but not the 12th,

00:06:46.676 --> 00:06:48.876
you are likely to succumb to the disease.

00:06:48.916 --> 00:06:50.396
But if you master the 12 steps,

00:06:50.436 --> 00:06:52.436
you're more likely
to overcome the disease.

00:06:52.476 --> 00:06:56.556
That 12th step is to help
another alcoholic.

00:06:56.596 --> 00:06:57.916
It's service.

00:06:57.956 --> 00:07:00.116
And so there's a great irony
when we need help